      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>Use in conjunction with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRot2Axis" target="_blank">llRot2Axis</a>.</p>
  <p>To undo use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlAxisAngle2Rot" target="_blank">llAxisAngle2Rot</a>.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <p>This always returns a positive angle &lt;= PI radians, that is, it is the unsigned minimum angle. A rotation of 3/2 PI radians (270 degrees) will return an angle of PI / 2 radians, not -PI / 2.</p>
